    <h2 class="h4">About the book</h2>
    <p>Sports looks at the Australian obsession with sport and sporting heroes, from suburban football fields to the country's biggest sporting institutions. It grew out of a 1969 La Trobe Library exhibition on Victoria's sporting past, and argues that sport, more than politics or war, is the real key to the Australian character.</p>
